/T (Sample Observation In one patient sample, electrolyte levels were observed to be below normal ranges, indicating conditions such as hyponatremia, hypokalemia, hypocalcemia, and hypochloremia. These imbalances can be associated with dehydration, renal dysfunction, or metabolic disorders.)
